[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2456610603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98836#issuecomment-2456610603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98836","id":2456610603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SbOcr","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T09:05:33Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T09:05:33Z","body":"I initially suggested about using `INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE` instead of `nullptr` so we could have something that `clang-tidy` would respect, but at the same time look less alien to Win32 than `nullptr`. However, on a second thought, that wasn't a good idea since `INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE` only works as a API-specific null for _some_ Win32 functions. So, I'm regreting my suggestion. Still, I'd consider we could have some sort of `NULL_HANDLE` that stands out in code dealing with Win32 and that `clang-tidy` will respect. Or, well, maybe we can just live with `nullptr`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2456610603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2456630528","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98836#issuecomment-2456630528","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98836","id":2456630528,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SbTUA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T09:14:08Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T09:14:08Z","body":"> since INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE only works as a API-specific null for some Win32 functions.\r\n\r\n`NULL` is `0` and `INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE` is `-1`, so these are not interchangeable and used in different cases (`INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE` to indicate error, `NULL` as empty/default value). I guess we can have `NULL_HANDLE = 0` for clarity.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2456630528/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457371313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98836#issuecomment-2457371313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98836","id":2457371313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SeIKx","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T14:46:55Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T14:46:55Z","body":"Seeing as the original concern was rescinded, I'm closing this PR. If `NULL_HANDLE` is still desired, I'd sooner have that PR via someone more familiar with the Win32 API","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457371313/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]